{"id":"52acb2f008e0c3ff","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-universal-existential.md","title":"全称公式与存在公式","display":"df-universal-existential — 全称公式与存在公式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-universal-existential","aliases":["29-df-universal-existential"],"display":"df-universal-existential — 全称公式与存在公式","depends_on":["[[29-df-formula]]","[[29-df-quantifier-rank]]"],"revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(2).zip修订；既有原书定位、日期和过往核对叙述作为继承记录，未重新取得或查看原书原件","revision_verification":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-universal-existential"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-universal-existential</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-universal-existential — 全称公式与存在公式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a04c13fd73e2c1c\" href=\"?note=5a04c13fd73e2c1c\" title=\"29-df-quantifier-rank\">29-df-quantifier-rank</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(2).zip修订；既有原书定位、日期和过往核对叙述作为继承记录，未重新取得或查看原书原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> 为对应公式与变量集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{qr}\">\\(\\operatorname{qr}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a04c13fd73e2c1c\" href=\"?note=5a04c13fd73e2c1c\" title=\"29-df-quantifier-rank\">29-df-quantifier-rank</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 是任意有限变量元组，允许空元组，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\">\\(\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\)</span>。量词块的实际语法树由下式递归构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vert\">\\(\\Vert\\)</span> 为元组串接。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QBlock}_\\tau(Q,\\langle\\rangle,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\phi,\\qquad\\operatorname{QBlock}_\\tau(Q,\\langle x\\rangle\\Vert\\bar y,\\phi)\\coloneqq Qx\\,\\operatorname{QBlock}_\\tau(Q,\\bar y,\\phi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{QBlock}_\\tau(Q,\\langle\\rangle,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\phi,\\qquad\\operatorname{QBlock}_\\tau(Q,\\langle x\\rangle\\Vert\\bar y,\\phi)\\coloneqq Qx\\,\\operatorname{QBlock}_\\tau(Q,\\bar y,\\phi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(Q\\bar x)\\phi\\coloneqq\\operatorname{QBlock}_\\tau(Q,\\bar x,\\phi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(Q\\bar x)\\phi\\coloneqq\\operatorname{QBlock}_\\tau(Q,\\bar x,\\phi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QFml}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\{\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\mid\\operatorname{qr}(\\chi)=0\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{QFml}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\{\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\mid\\operatorname{qr}(\\chi)=0\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Universal}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{(\\forall\\bar x)\\psi\\mid\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{&lt;\\omega},\\ \\psi\\in\\mathrm{QFml}_\\tau\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Existential}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{(\\exists\\bar x)\\psi\\mid\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{&lt;\\omega},\\ \\psi\\in\\mathrm{QFml}_\\tau\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Universal}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{(\\forall\\bar x)\\psi\\mid\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{&lt;\\omega},\\ \\psi\\in\\mathrm{QFml}_\\tau\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Existential}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{(\\exists\\bar x)\\psi\\mid\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{&lt;\\omega},\\ \\psi\\in\\mathrm{QFml}_\\tau\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>空量词块保留原矩阵，因此无量词公式包含在两个片段中。本条定义公式片段，不额外要求其为闭句。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-quantifier-rank","status":"resolved","id":"5a04c13fd73e2c1c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-quantifier-rank]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-quantifier-rank","status":"resolved","id":"5a04c13fd73e2c1c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{qr}$ 见 [[29-df-quantifier-rank]]；$\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{<\\omega}$ 是任意有限变量元组，允许空元组，$Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}$，$\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau$。量词块的实际语法树由下式递归构造；$\\Vert$ 为元组串接。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{qr}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\Vert","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{QBlock}_\\tau(Q,\\langle\\rangle,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\phi,\\qquad\\operatorname{QBlock}_\\tau(Q,\\langle x\\rangle\\Vert\\bar y,\\phi)\\coloneqq Qx\\,\\operatorname{QBlock}_\\tau(Q,\\bar y,\\phi).","display":true},{"tex":"(Q\\bar x)\\phi\\coloneqq\\operatorname{QBlock}_\\tau(Q,\\bar x,\\phi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QFml}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\{\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\mid\\operatorname{qr}(\\chi)=0\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Universal}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{(\\forall\\bar x)\\psi\\mid\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{<\\omega},\\ \\psi\\in\\mathrm{QFml}_\\tau\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Existential}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{(\\exists\\bar x)\\psi\\mid\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{<\\omega},\\ \\psi\\in\\mathrm{QFml}_\\tau\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1806,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-202","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-polynomial-advice]]、[[29-prop-advice-properties]]、[[29-df-qsat]]、[[29-df-extension-axioms]]、[[29-df-universal-existential]]：比特串编码及唯一确定的有限语法构造。"},{"id":"881fccdc7af5ace3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Existential}[\\tau],\\mathrm{Universal}[\\tau]$ 见 [[29-df-universal-existential]]；$\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau$ 与满足关系见 [[29-df-sentence]]、[[29-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-148","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-universal-existential]]"}],"outgoing":["a3fa1d78e657e6a2","5a04c13fd73e2c1c"]}